<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Dear {!IndividualApplication.COE_Approver__c},<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">After careful review of the proposal and the presentation
before the Selection Committee, we would like to inform you that the application
titled </span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">“</b><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">”</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"> submitted by the&nbsp;</span><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!IndividualApplication.COE_Location__c}</font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">WIN-COE has not
been selected for funding support by the&nbsp;</span><font face="arial">{!IndividualApplication.Account}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">The review panel’s comments and feedback:</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!IndividualApplication.WIN_Approval_Comments__c}.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">You are encouraged to consider these recommendations should
you wish to revise and resubmit the proposal in future rounds of calls for
applications.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please don’t hesitate to reach out to WIN team at win.support@wadhwanifoundation.org<span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;if you would like to discuss the feedback or next steps.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">







</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,<br>
<b>Wadhwani Foundation</b><o:p></o:p></p><br><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p>]]></td>
